  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a loud celebration party, Toru Muranishi raises a glass to forty-seven store openings in three months and sets his sights on one hundred. Meanwhile, Takei raids a delivery van—where the old picture-book trick suddenly stops working—and Muranishi slips away to go home. Listen to the celebratory toasts and the sudden police raid.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "おかげで三カ月で四十七店出店できた。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "次は百店目指そう。乾杯！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "荷物を見せろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "全部絵本ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "いいから出せ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "よく見てくださいよ、刑事さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "もういいですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "ご苦労さまでした。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "よし、逮捕しろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お前らにボーナスだ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "帰る。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Celebration and danger collide here: Muranishi rallies his crew at the hall while Takei springs a trap at the warehouse. Let's hear the key lines.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "おかげで三カ月で四十七店出店できた。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thanks to you all, we opened forty-seven stores in three months.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "次は百店目指そう。乾杯！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Next, let us aim for one hundred stores. Cheers!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "荷物を見せろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Show me the cargo.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "全部絵本ですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They are all picture books.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "いいから出せ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Never mind that, bring them out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "よく見てくださいよ、刑事さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take a good look, detective.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "driver",
      "t": "もういいですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are we good to go now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "よし、逮捕しろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, arrest him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お前らにボーナスだ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is a bonus for all of you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "帰る。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am going home.'",
